          "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/u/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
          "created_at": "2026-11-06T09:20:44.339Z",
          "cooked": "<p>Hi Shopify Community,</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’m building WindWalker Operations, an embedded Shopify app pilot for merchants whose purchasing and receiving process does not fit one fixed workflow.</p>\n<p>Recent community discussions show that the challenge is often the full operating sequence—not only a missing field: supplier ordering, purchase orders, transfers, partial deliveries, invoice checks, landed cost, quality control, receiving, and inventory release can differ by store.</p>\n<p>Our pilot does not replace Shopify or make unsupported Purchase Order API claims. It reads supported store context, lets an operator describe review rules in ordinary language, creates a private exception queue, saves revision checkpoints, and requires explicit approval before any supported live action. Unsupported steps remain clearly marked as manual or CSV-assisted.</p>\n<p>The first workflow focuses on purchasing and receiving exceptions. We are looking for merchants willing to describe one real weekly workflow and review an early private pilot.</p>\n<p>I would especially value input on:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>How do you place supplier orders today?</li>\n<li>How do you handle partial deliveries and backorders?</li>\n<li>Which invoice, cost, barcode, label, or location step creates the most rework?</li>\n<li>Which action must always require manager approval?</li>\n<li>What would make you trust an app enough to use it every week?</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The pilot starts read-only. No Shopify data is changed without an explicit supported action and approval. I will publish what works, what fails, and which steps remain limited by Shopify’s public APIs.</p>\n<p>Disclosure: I am the developer of WindWalker Operations. This post is for workflow research and pilot participation, not a claim that the full purchasing process is already automated.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/original/4X/6/7/f/67f2c62d7ad145568df53b13cf57626393230bdd.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/ePzjSw4uZvog9DMQyhOVnGS6pKB.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/optimized/4X/6/7/f/67f2c62d7ad145568df53b13cf57626393230bdd_2_257x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ePzjSw4uZvog9DMQyhOVnGS6pKB\" width=\"257\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/optimized/4X/6/7/f/67f2c62d7ad145568df53b13cf57626393230bdd_2_257x500.jpeg, https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/optimized/4X/6/7/f/67f2c62d7ad145568df53b13cf57626393230bdd_2_385x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/optimized/4X/6/7/f/67f2c62d7ad145568df53b13cf57626393230bdd_2_514x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">919×1786 239 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/original/4X/7/9/8/79839852cbc13749125852695270c81e3627d5f3.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/hkXIkegdeV2o4I2xYjQqKQH56hR.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/optimized/4X/7/9/8/79839852cbc13749125852695270c81e3627d5f3_2_690x404.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hkXIkegdeV2o4I2xYjQqKQH56hR\" width=\"690\" height=\"404\" srcset=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/optimized/4X/7/9/8/79839852cbc13749125852695270c81e3627d5f3_2_690x404.png, https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/optimized/4X/7/9/8/79839852cbc13749125852695270c81e3627d5f3_2_1035x606.png 1.5x, https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/optimized/4X/7/9/8/79839852cbc13749125852695270c81e3627d5f3_2_1380x808.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F9FA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1644×964 137 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/original/4X/7/9/8/79839852cbc13749125852695270c81e3627d5f3.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/hkXIkegdeV2o4I2xYjQqKQH56hR.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/optimized/4X/7/9/8/79839852cbc13749125852695270c81e3627d5f3_2_690x404.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hkXIkegdeV2o4I2xYjQqKQH56hR\" width=\"690\" height=\"404\" srcset=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/optimized/4X/7/9/8/79839852cbc13749125852695270c81e3627d5f3_2_690x404.png, https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/optimized/4X/7/9/8/79839852cbc13749125852695270c81e3627d5f3_2_1035x606.png 1.5x, https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/optimized/4X/7/9/8/79839852cbc13749125852695270c81e3627d5f3_2_1380x808.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F9FA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1644×964 137 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
